### Menu
GET http://localhost:8080/dishes

### One dish
GET http://localhost:8080/dishes/1

### Create order (201, 400, 404, 409 or 502)
POST http://localhost:8080/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{"dishId": 1, "quantity": 2}

### Order by id
GET http://localhost:8080/orders/1

### Invalid quantity (400)
POST http://localhost:8080/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{"dishId": 1, "quantity": 0}

### Review (202 Accepted, published to RabbitMQ)
POST http://localhost:8080/reviews
Content-Type: application/json

{"dishId": 1, "rating": 5, "comment": "Great"}

### Invalid rating (400)
POST http://localhost:8080/reviews
Content-Type: application/json

{"dishId": 1, "rating": 9, "comment": "Too good"}

### Ranking (review-service, refreshed every 5 s)
GET http://localhost:8083/reviews/ranking

### Assistant: on topic
POST http://localhost:8080/assistant
Content-Type: application/json

{"question": "Tem prato vegetariano até R$ 40?"}

### Assistant: off topic (should politely refuse)
POST http://localhost:8080/assistant
Content-Type: application/json

{"question": "Quem ganhou a Copa de 2002?"}

### Payment-service direct (internal; the app never calls it)
POST http://localhost:8081/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{"amount": 79.80}
